&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with building and maintaining a SIEM comprised of open-source and hosted components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience securing consumer-facing web and iOS / Android applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing policies and administering Vault &amp;amp; other Hashicorp products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing security vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
